=head1 NAME

LeanBridge::OwnedProbe - Generated owned Lean values

=head1 API

=head2 apply_twice

Calls C<Owned.applyTwice> in the compiled Lean component.

=head2 bundle

Calls C<Owned.bundle> in the compiled Lean component.

=head2 callback_record

Calls C<Owned.callbackRecord> in the compiled Lean component.

=head2 callback_recursive

Calls C<Owned.callbackRecursive> in the compiled Lean component.

=head2 dispatch

Calls C<Owned.dispatch> in the compiled Lean component.

=head2 echo_alias

