Calls C<Owned.echoOption> in the compiled Lean component.

=head2 echo_record

Calls C<Owned.echoRecord> in the compiled Lean component.

=head2 echo_recursive

Calls C<Owned.echoRecursive> in the compiled Lean component.

=head2 echo_result

